  ENDORSEMENT_RECEIVED
  ENDORSEMENT_PAYOFF
  NO_APPLICANT_NUDGE
  // Added 2026-08-27, batches A18/A23/A25. CANCELLATION_RESOLVED closes the loop a pending
  // CANCELLATION_REQUEST opens; the two rating values carry FR-NOTIF-11; DISPUTE_OPENED and
  // DISPUTE_RESOLVED carry FR-NOTIF-12, without which a respondent's 48-hour window ran on a
  // case they were never told existed; FLAGGED_CONTENT_OUTCOME tells a content owner what came
  // of the auto-hide, the threshold-silent ruling's outcome notice.
  CANCELLATION_RESOLVED
  RATING_WINDOW_OPEN
  RATING_REVEALED
  DISPUTE_OPENED
  DISPUTE_RESOLVED
  FLAGGED_CONTENT_OUTCOME
